1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,484
In February 2024, the pre-debut single Stuck In The Middle showed a softer register — and AH-hyun's absence on it said more than any statement.

2
00:00:09,484 --> 00:00:14,420
Fans began tracking her like astronomers tracking an object behind the sun.

3
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,863
Sightings: none.

4
00:00:15,863 --> 00:00:17,332
Statements: none.

5
00:00:17,332 --> 00:00:21,005
But if you knew Y-G's patterns, the silence had a shape.

6
00:00:21,005 --> 00:00:25,038
The company had done this before, with artists it intended to keep.

